      "title": "sdd/plugin-doc-site/design",
      "content": "**What**: SDD design for `plugin-doc-site` — Astro 4 + Starlight + GSAP 3, static output (no Vercel adapter), deployed at Vercel project `agent007-doc` with `doc/` as root directory.\n\n**Why**: Resolve 4 deferred implementation questions from DECISIONS + design-level risks R1–R6 from proposal so sdd-tasks can decompose without ambiguity.\n\n**Where**: `.sdlc/specs/plugin-doc-site/design.md`. Will scaffold fresh `doc/` directory (confirmed empty on disk).\n\n**Key decisions (ADRs)**:\n- ADR-001: Custom SVG + GSAP for hero tree (rejected D3 for bundle, Canvas for a11y). ~80 LOC tidy-tree layout.\n- ADR-002: `client:visible` hydration with GSAP hoisted in Base layout as `window.__gsap`. Solves R5.\n- ADR-003: Static output, no `@astrojs/vercel` adapter (zero dynamic routes).\n- ADR-004: Pre-recorded JSON event streams in `src/content/sims/` replayed by 20-LOC scheduler. Zero network at runtime. Schema: phase/agent_spawn/agent_log/envelope/state_transition/converge.\n- ADR-005: Mobile = same animation, simplified tree (≤12 nodes under 768px). prefers-reduced-motion skips timeline.\n- ADR-006: Starlight installed but landing page is custom; Starlight reserved for future /docs/*.\n\n**GSAP plugin manifest**: gsap + ScrollTrigger + Flip (~38 KB gz). NO MotionPath/TextPlugin/Draggable.\n\n**Performance budgets**: HTML ≤30KB, critical CSS ≤15KB, initial JS ≤50KB, total JS ≤300KB, fonts ≤80KB (JetBrains Mono Nerd Font subset Latin+box-drawing+Katakana), LCP \u003c1.8s p75 4G.\n\n**Project structure**: `doc/` with components/{Hero,PipelineAnimation,EcosystemGrid,InstallTerminal,RoadmapTimeline,WatchItThink,CookieBanner}, content collections for sims+roadmap+ecosystem, `scripts/build-tree.ts` prebuild step.\n\n**Learned**: Hoisting GSAP at the base layout level (single fetch, exposed via window.__gsap) is the cleanest way to share runtime across Astro islands without duplicating bundle. `client:load` on 6 islands would blow the 50KB initial JS budget — `client:visible` defers all but the hero.",
