      "title": "sdd/plugin-doc-site/spec",
      "content": "**What**: Delta spec for plugin-doc-site — behavioral contracts (Given/When/Then) for all 6 scroll sections plus global requirements and out-of-scope lock.\n\n**Why**: SDD spec phase for the Agent007 documentation site. Captures WHAT each section must do, not HOW — implementation decisions deferred to sdd-design.\n\n**Where**: `.sdlc/specs/plugin-doc-site/spec.md`\n\n**Spec summary by section:**\n\n1. **Hero** — Identity text in DOM within 1s; ASCII typewriter completes 4s ±200ms; tree transformation 8s; hover dims non-focused branches to ≤40% opacity; JS-off shows all content; prefers-reduced-motion skips all transforms; JetBrains Mono Nerd Font self-hosted woff2 ensures cross-browser sniper glyph rendering.\n\n2. **SDD Pipeline Animation** — Auto-starts on scroll-into-view; 8-step loop (propose→archive); each step visible ≥2s; pause on hover within one frame; click-to-restart from step 1; mobile \u003c640px gets static infographic (no animated loop).\n\n3. **Ecosystem Grid** — All tiles visible on initial render (no skeleton); hover expands tile in ≤200ms, neighbors shift, content reveals; Tab order matches visual order, focus ring WCAG AA, Enter/Space expands; lifecycle group tabs filter to group-only tiles with no ghost whitespace; all 5 groups visible with no filter active.\n\n4. **Install Terminal** — Typewriter 40–80ms/char; copy button writes exact string `claude plugin install agent007` to clipboard, shows confirmation 2s; zero network on copy; mock output uses terminal-green/amber accents.\n\n5. **Roadmap Timeline** — Horizontal scroll on desktop ≥1024px; vertical stack on mobile \u003c640px; click/Enter expands node (≤300ms); consistent single-or-multi expand behavior.\n\n6. **Watch it Think** — Trigger via typed input or preset; 6 SDD phases play in order with stream output (pre-recorded JSON, bundled statically); 15–60s total; zero network requests (DevTools verifiable); reset restores initial state without page reload; works offline.\n\n**Global requirements:**\n- LCP \u003c 2.0s (Lighthouse mobile 4G)\n- WCAG AA: zero contrast violations, all interactives have accessible names, visual assets have aria-label\n- Analytics consent gate: Vercel Analytics fires ONLY after cookie banner accept\n- Clean Vercel build: exit 0, zero serverless functions, static output only, root dir = `doc/`\n- JetBrains Mono Nerd Font self-hosted woff2 with `font-display: swap`\n\n**Out-of-scope locks**: SSR/ISR, auth, comments, i18n, Algolia search, competitor tables, sponsor buttons, blog, custom serverless functions.\n\n**Spec-level assumptions (from orchestrator resolutions):**\n- R1: site path is `doc/` (fresh)\n- R4: Watch it Think = pre-recorded JSON stream, no API calls\n- R6: JetBrains Mono Nerd Font woff2 self-hosted\n- R3: Vercel Analytics chosen\n- R7: 48h cooldown post-verify, polish is v1.1\n\n**Learned**: sdd-design still needs to resolve: tree viz library, GSAP hydration directive for Astro islands, mobile hero fallback strategy, additional GSAP plugins.",
