      "title": "sdd-init/juegos",
      "content": "## SDD Init — juegos (Triki educational game)\n\n### Project Overview\nGreenfield Vanilla JS project. Triki (tic-tac-toe) educational game built in 4 phases. Core philosophy: engine first, never start with the visual layer.\n\n### Stack (current)\n- Nothing installed — completely greenfield\n- Single file: `logic_triki_SDD_v1.docx` (design doc, already processed, do NOT read as binary)\n- No package.json, no git repo, no source files\n\n### Stack (planned by phase)\n- **Fase 0** (~1 day): Pure Vanilla JS engine — board state, minimax bot, player API (`celda()`, `celda_libre()`, `bot_jugó_en()`, `jugar()`). NO Three.js, NO visual. Testeable in browser console and via node --test.\n- **Fase 1** (~2 days): Vite + Three.js 2D board with X/O pieces and winning line animation\n- **Fase 2** (~2 days): CodeMirror 6 editor overlay + reflexes (green/yellow/red/gray) synced to engine execution\n- **Fase 3** (~3 days): Pseudocode-to-JS transpiler (Spanish keywords: si/sino/mientras)\n\n### Testing\n- **Fase 0**: `node --test` (Node built-in, zero install)\n- **Fase 1+**: Vitest (native ESM, Vite-integrated)\n- **strict_tdd**: false (no runner installed; set to true once Vitest arrives)\n- No E2E or integration layers planned yet\n\n### Architecture Conventions (proposed)\n- Screaming Architecture: folders by feature → `board/`, `bot/`, `api/`, `engine/`\n- Pure functions wherever possible — no hidden state mutations\n- No premature abstractions — YAGNI\n- ES Modules (import/export) — no CommonJS\n- Spanish keywords for pseudocode transpiler (Fase 3): si, sino, mientras\n\n### SDD Config\n- **Artifact store**: engram\n- **Execution mode**: interactive\n- **Language**: Spanish (Rioplatense voseo); UI text and pseudocode keywords in Spanish\n\n### Engram Topic Keys\n- `sdd-init/juegos` — this record\n- `sdd/juegos/testing-capabilities` — testing capabilities cache\n- `skill-registry` — skill registry for sub-agent injection\n\n### Skill Registry\n- File: `/Users/sebasing/Projects/Juegos/.atl/skill-registry.md`\n- Engram ID: #8\n\n### Next Recommended\n`/sdd-new triki-engine` — start exploration of Fase 0 pure JS engine",
