      "content": "# Tasks: Triki Engine — Fase 0\n\n**Change**: `triki-engine`\n**Artifact store**: engram\n**Test runner**: `node --test`\n**TDD style**: RED (write failing test) → GREEN (implement) — per module, leaf-first\n**Total tasks**: 47 (Batches 0–6)\n\n---\n\n## Batch 0 — Project Bootstrap (no dependencies)\n\n- [x] **T-001** | Create folder skeleton\n  - `depends_on`: []\n  - `files`: `src/board/`, `src/bot/`, `src/api/`, `src/engine/` (empty dirs via `.gitkeep` placeholders)\n  - `verification`: directory structure exists — `ls src/`\n  - `acceptance_criteria`: AC-none (infrastructure)\n\n- [x] **T-002** | Create `package.json`\n  - `depends_on`: [T-001]\n  - `files`: `package.json`\n  - content: `{ \"type\": \"module\", \"scripts\": { \"test\": \"node --test --test-timeout=2000\" } }` — zero runtime deps\n  - `verification`: `node -e \"import('./src/index.js')\"` resolves without module-type error\n  - `acceptance_criteria`: AC-none (infrastructure)\n\n- [x] **T-003** | Create `.gitignore`\n  - `depends_on`: [T-001]\n  - `files`: `.gitignore`\n  - content: `node_modules/`, `.DS_Store`, `dist/`, `*.log`\n  - `verification`: file exists and contains `node_modules/`\n  - `acceptance_criteria`: AC-none\n\n- [x] **T-004** | Create `src/index.js` placeholder\n  - `depends_on`: [T-002]\n  - `files`: `src/index.js`\n  - content: placeholder `export function runGame() {}` + `export const VERSION = '0.0.1'` — real implementation arrives in T-042\n  - `verification`: `node -e \"import('./src/index.js').then(m =\u003e console.log(typeof m.runGame))\"` prints `function`\n  - `acceptance_criteria`: AC-none (will be replaced)\n\n- [x] **T-005** | Create `README.md` stub\n  - `depends_on`: [T-002]\n  - `files`: `README.md`\n  - content: usage snippet (node + browser), Fase 0 limitations note (busy-loop), `npx serve .` instruction\n  - `verification`: file exists, contains \"npx serve\" and \"ERR_INFINITE_LOOP\" limitation callout\n  - `acceptance_criteria`: AC-none\n\n