0)` → `getErrors()` includes `ERR_COORD_OUT_OF_RANGE`; occupied cell → `ERR_CELL_OCCUPIED`\n  - `verification`: `node --test src/api/buildPlayerAPI.test.js` — fails\n  - `acceptance_criteria`: AC-04, AC-05, AC-07, AC-08\n\n- [ ] **T-024** | RED — `api/buildPlayerAPI` tests — read globals behavior\n  - `depends_on`: [T-022]\n  - `files`: `src/api/buildPlayerAPI.test.js` (extend)\n  - tests: `celda(0,0)` on board with `'X'` at [0][0] returns `'X'`; `celda_libre(0,0)` returns false; `bot_jugó_en(0,0)` returns true when bot has piece there; `yo_jugué_en(0,0)` returns true; `última_jugada_bot()` returns `[-1,-1]` on turn 0; `turno` returns the turn index passed to factory; `mi_símbolo === 'X'`; `bot_símbolo === 'O'`\n  - `verification`: `node --test src/api/buildPlayerAPI.test.js` — fails\n  - `acceptance_criteria`: AC-09, AC-13\n\n- [ ] **T-025** | RED — `api/buildPlayerAPI` tests — `turno` read-only\n  - `depends_on`: [T-022]\n  - `files`: `src/api/buildPlayerAPI.test.js` (extend)\n  - test: install globals on temp object; attempt `globalThis.turno = 99`; assert `turno` is still the original value (non-writable property descriptor)\n  - `verification`: `node --test src/api/buildPlayerAPI.test.js` — fails\n  - `acceptance_criteria`: AC-13\n\n- [ ] **T-026** | GREEN — implement `api/buildPlayerAPI.js`\n  - `depends_on`: [T-022, T-023, T-024, T-025]\n  - `files`: `src/api/buildPlayerAPI.js`\n  - factory: `(boardState, { turn, lastBotMove })` → `{ globals, getPendingMove, getErrors }`; closure-captured `pendingMove` + `turnErrors[]`; read-only state vars via `Object.defineProperty({ writable: false, configurable: true })`; `última_jugada_bot()` returns `lastBotMove ?? [-1,-1]`; `jugar()` validates coords, occupied, idempotency — pushes to `turnErrors`, does NOT throw\n  - `verification`: `node --test src/api/buildPlayerAPI.test.js` — all pass\n  - `acceptance_criteria`: AC-04, AC-05, AC-07, AC-08, AC-09, AC-13\n\n---\n\n## Batch 4 — Engine Module (depends on board/, bot/, 